Uval-Code translation:
"A factory has a production line that produces different types of chocolate. For normal chocolate, the melting-, mixing-, and colling-station is needed. For the production of nut-chocolate, all mentioned statitions for normal chocolate and an additional baking-station is required. All lines require a logistic-system and a packaging station. "
This translation maintains the original meaning while adhering to Uval-Code syntax rules.